      "term_id": "BT-013",
      "term": "Financial Business Term",
      "definition": "One of the standardized financial metric terms in the business glossary (e.g., Revenue, Total Assets, Net Income) that serve as the common language for cross-company financial comparison. XBRL concepts map to these terms through the tag normalization process. Terms critical to operations are flagged with is_cde=true.",
